# Your global gitignore excludes .claude/ (to stop AI session state from
# leaking into random project repos). This repo deliberately tracks a
# curated subset of AI tool config under home/, so un-ignore it here.
!home/.claude/
!home/.claude/**

# Global gitignore also excludes scripts/. The Codex agent converter lives here.
!scripts/
!scripts/**

# Cursor user rule (agents/skills are copied from home/.claude by setup.sh).
!home/.cursor/
!home/.cursor/rules/
!home/.cursor/rules/**
